    description: "Same pattern as JS fix (PR #1992, INV-jahom): _get_enclosing_function returns None for top-level code, dropping all call edges. Bash most impactful (scripts are inherently top-level). PHP, Perl, PowerShell also affected. Fix: create module symbol, use as fallback. TDD."  # a4b8
